title: "polars-baseball: The unified Polars-native baseball data SDK"
abstract: "A typed, async-first Python library for retrieving MLB and baseball analytics data from Statcast, Baseball Savant, FanGraphs, Baseball Reference, Lahman, Retrosheet, and the MLB Stats API natively into Polars DataFrames."
